    "updated_at": "2026-11-20T11:21:36Z",
    "body": "The implementation reference is the public [Agie-CAM MIT-licensed source at 11b1bb9](https://github.com/qsmits/Agie-CAM/tree/11b1bb9ef2c752b94b6fefc1f0814acd2e030c42). Its source comments identify the origin of the interface arguments and the technology selection.\n\nThe [EZ-CAM AgieVision guide](https://www.ez-cam.de/downloads/v2017_edm_news.pdf) describes the controller files. The [Kovoprog manual, section 3.4.1](https://www.kovoprog.cz/pictures/files/manuals/MainBook_kpd_en_open.pdf) shows JEScript object and attribute calls. The [Cimatron AgieVision guide](https://help.cimatron.com/en/2026/wizards/agievision/wedm_w_agv_step_5_7.htm) describes the quality targets. These sources do not establish every argument and default in the proposed job.\n\nThe contribution needs a maintainer decision on this reference, or a suitable published interface specification. Requested classification: enhancement, P6, effort:max, area:post, source:agent. The change adds support for a controller file format. The contributor account cannot set the labels.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
