    "body": "Thank you, @qsmits. The first case and the offline-control check you made are a good start.\n\nTriage:\n- **P6**: an accepted enhancement, not yet scheduled.\n- **effort:high**: a new post that writes machine output (three linked files), so it is under the safety floor.\n- **area:post**\n- It depends on the machine template in #2946.\n",
